    "description": "<p>This set of specialized fingerless gloves, shoes, and kneepads is designed to emulate the pads on gecko feet. You can support yourself on a wall or ceiling by placing any two of these pads against any surface not made from a material specially designed to resist such devices. You can climb any surface and move easily across walls and ceilings that can support your weight; apply a +30 modifier to climbing-based Athletics Tests. In addition to climbing, these devices are also very popular in zero-g environments.</p>",
